            "description": "PROPOWAX™ SERIES\nANTIOXIDANT • ANTIPOLLUTION\n\n100% Clean, Sustainable, Cruelty-free Beauty\n10.1 fl. oz. / 300 ml\n\nThe PROPOWAX™ Antioxidant Conditioner nourishes, detangles, and restores hair while soothing and balancing the scalp. Powered by the patented Living Honeycomb, proven to deliver the highest antioxidant activity worldwide, this formula protects against oxidative stress while moisturizing and smoothing split ends. Leaves hair silky, frizz-free, and enveloped in Apiceuticals’ signature ultra-luxury fragrance.\n\nHow to Use: After cleansing (preferably with Antioxidant Shampoo PROPOWAX™ Series), apply a small amount to scalp and hair. Massage gently to allow antioxidants and oils to penetrate. Leave it for 3-5 mins. Rinse thoroughly with lukewarm water. For a spa-like ritual, follow with Antioxidant Dry Oil PROPOWAX™ Series.\n\nIngredients and Safety: Aqua (Water), Cetearyl Alcohol, Behentrimonium Chloride, Betaine, Glycerin, Olea Europaea (Olive) Fruit Oil, Honey/mel, Melissa Officinalis Flower Extract, Helianthus Annuus (Sunflower) Seed Oil, Propolis Cera, Propolis Extract, Beeswax (Cera alba), Chamomilla Recutita (Chamomile) Flower Extract, Crambe Abyssinica Seed Oil, Passiflora Edulis Seed Oil, Phytosterols, Aloe Barbadensis Leaf Extract, Sodium Gluconate, Sodium Benzoate, Potassium Sorbate, Sodium Levulinate, Oleyl Alcohol, Isopropyl Alcohol, Parfum (Fragrance), Hexyl Cinnamal.",
