            "description": "PROPOWAX™ SERIES\nANTIOXIDANT • ANTIPOLLUTION\n\n100% Clean, Sustainable, Cruelty-free Beauty\n10.1 fl. oz. / 300 ml\n\nThe PROPOWAX™ Antioxidant Body Lotion envelops the skin in silky hydration while fortifying it with advanced antioxidant protection. Powered by the patented Living Honeycomb, clinically proven to deliver the highest antioxidant activity worldwide, it locks in moisture, restores the skin barrier, and protects against pollution and oxidative stress. With its lightweight, non-greasy texture, it leaves skin velvety soft, supple, and wrapped in Apiceuticals’ signature ultra-luxury fragrance.\n\nHow to Use: Warm a coin-sized amount of lotion between your palms. Massage onto the body in gentle, circular motions, preferably after showering with PROPOWAX™ Antioxidant Shower Gel, while skin is still slightly damp.\n\nFor ultimate nourishment, complete the ritual with PROPOWAX™ Antioxidant Dry Oil.\n\nIngredients and Safety: Aqua (Water), Glycerin, Ethylhexyl Palmitate, Cetearyl Isonanoate, Prunus Amygdalus Dulcis (Sweet Almond) Oil, Olus Oil, Polyglyceryl-2 Dipolyhydroxystearate, Parfum (Fragrance), Passiflora Edulis Seed Oil, Lauryl Glucoside, Melissa Officinalis Flower Extract, Olea Europaea (Olive) Fruit Oil, Butyrospermum Parkii (Shea) Butter, Aloe Barbadensis Leaf Extract, Helianthus Annuus (Sunflower) Seed Oil, Sesamum Indicum (Sesame) Seed Oil, Vitis Vinifera (Grape) Seed Oil, Propolis Cera, Propolis Extract, Beeswax (Cera alba), Glyceryl Oleate, Dicaprylyl Carbonate, Carbomer, Sodium Stearoyl Glutamate, BHT, Sodium Benzoate, Potassium Sorbate, Honey/mel, Disodium EDTA, Benzyl Alcohol, Phenoxyethanol, Ethylhexylglycerin, Sodium Hydroxide, Hexyl Cinnamal, Limonene, Geraniol, Eugenol.",
